/-!
# Kernel-authority closure certificate for the localized universal-semantic batch

This module adds an independent `assert_kernel_only` check for every public authored declaration of
the twenty approved source modules of the localized universal-semantic completion/support batch:

* `TetraStereo.OneCenter.LocalizedEndpointSemanticCompletion`
* `TetraStereo.OneCenter.LocalizedPhysicalReferenceUniqueness`
* `TetraStereo.OneCenter.LocalizedEndpointFrameCompletenessBridge`
* `TetraStereo.OneCenter.LocalizedRule45DeclarativeAgreement`
